license: "CC-BY-4.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/rakibnuist/bangladesh-study-abroad-dataset"
url: "https://eduexpressint.com/press"
abstract: >-
  Open, CC BY 4.0 dataset of 362 verified active universities
  (353 in China across 93 cities and 9 in Malaysia),
  1796 degree and language programs, 1497 itemized non-tuition fee rows,
  682 structured university scholarship tracks, a 32-country
  global Bangladesh outbound cost/visa matrix, and 54 Bangladesh-eligible
  flagship national scholarships covering Bangladesh Bank AD Student File rules, statutory visa
  financial proofs, and explicit single-year CNY tuition quartiles.
keywords:
